hints.pseudocode:
sort bags from biggest to smallest; totals = zero for every child; best = infinity
go(i):
  if i == n: best = min(best, max(totals)); return
  seen = empty set
  for each child c:
    if totals[c] in seen: continue           (same situation as an earlier child)
    seen.add(totals[c])
    if totals[c] + bags[i] >= best: continue (cannot beat the best)
    totals[c] += bags[i]; go(i + 1); totals[c] -= bags[i]
